{"id":"01ffc7d74ae49152","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-set9-pointwise-intersection.md","title":"ZFC Set9 Pointwise Intersection","display":"df-zfc-set9-pointwise-intersection — ZFC Set9 Pointwise Intersection","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set9-pointwise-intersection","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set9-pointwise-intersection"],"display":"df-zfc-set9-pointwise-intersection — ZFC Set9 Pointwise Intersection","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set9-pointwise-intersection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set9-pointwise-intersection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set9-pointwise-intersection — ZFC Set9 Pointwise Intersection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J,\\mathcal F,x\\in V\">\\(J,\\mathcal F,x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}\\)</span>, and function application are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9PointwiseIntersection}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet9PointwiseIntersection}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}intersection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9PointwiseIntersection}_S(J,\\mathcal F,x)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal F\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land \\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists D,C\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\exists f_0\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\nx\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f_0)\n\\land\nJ=\\{y\\in f_0(x):\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;(x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\to y\\in f(x))\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}intersection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9PointwiseIntersection}_S(J,\\mathcal F,x)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal F\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land \\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists D,C\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\exists f_0\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\nx\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f_0)\n\\land\nJ=\\{y\\in f_0(x):\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;(x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\to y\\in f(x))\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The witness <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_0\">\\(f_0\\)</span> supplies a set bound for Separation; the resulting <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> is independent of the chosen witness because every eligible value, including <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_0(x)\">\\(f_0(x)\\)</span>, participates in the intersection.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$, $\\operatorname{dom}$, and function application are as in [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J,\\mathcal F,x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9PointwiseIntersection}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}intersection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9PointwiseIntersection}_S(J,\\mathcal F,x)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal F\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land \\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists D,C\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,C)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\n\\exists f_0\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\nx\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f_0)\n\\land\nJ=\\{y\\in f_0(x):\\forall f\\in\\mathcal F\\;(x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\to y\\in f(x))\\}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"f_0","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"f_0(x)","display":false}],"bytes":1311,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3463","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-set9-pointwise-intersection.md|58-df-zfc-set9-pointwise-intersection]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d74